
Compile / Build
===============

Requirements: CMake 3.16 or newer, a C++ compiler, Bison 2.4 or newer,
and Flex.

    cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
    cmake --build build

The executables are generated as `build/iec2c` and `build/iec2iec`.

Install
-------

    cmake --install build

Use `-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/path` while configuring to select a custom
installation prefix.

Cross-compiling
---------------

Pass a CMake toolchain file when configuring:

    cmake -S . -B build-windows \
      -DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=/path/to/mingw-toolchain.cmake \
      -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
    cmake --build build-windows

Clean build
-----------

Remove the selected build directory and configure it again. All generated
files are kept outside the source tree.
